# Generated compositions are NOT versioned.
#
# Every PNG in this folder is derived from the spec arrays in
# scripts/ad-campaign/. A full rebuild takes ~18 seconds:
#
#     cd scripts/ad-campaign && npm install && node build.js
#
# Why: git cannot delta-compress a PNG, so it stores a complete new copy of the
# file for every version. These are outputs that change whenever a headline
# changes, so committing them would grow history without bound — and removing
# them later needs a history rewrite (filter-repo/BFG), which invalidates every
# clone and every commit SHA on the branch Railway deploys from.
#
# NOTE: these files still exist on disk. This stops them being versioned, it
# does not delete them. `git clean -fdx` WOULD remove them — rebuild after.

01-quiet-signal/*.png
02-drawn/*.png
03-in-hand/*.png
graphics/*.png

# …except the contact sheets and the specimen. ~700 KB total, and they are the
# visual record — you can see every set on GitHub without cloning and building.
!01-quiet-signal/_contact-sheet.png
!02-drawn/_contact-sheet.png
!03-in-hand/_contact-sheet.png
!graphics/_specimen.png

# Kept deliberately, and not covered by the rules above:
#   screenshots/   real inputs — cannot be regenerated, must be versioned
#   graphics/*.svg text, 124 KB for all 47, diffs cleanly, the preferred format
